  "text": "def median(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return median of elements in the list l.\n    >>> median([3, 1, 2, 4, 5])\n    3\n    >>> median([-10, 4, 6, 1000, 10, 20])\n    15.0\n    \"\"\"\n    l.sort()\n    n = len(l)\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        return l[n // 2]\n    else:\n        return (l[n // 2 - 1] + l[n // 2]) / 2",
